==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы-|носи́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|выноси́ть|ann=y}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-выносить.ogg}}
* {{ru-IPA|вы́носить|ann=y}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|выноси́ть|impf|pf=вы́нести}}

# to [[carry out]], to [[take out]], to [[bring out]], to [[remove]]
# to [[transfer]]
# to [[get]], to [[acquire]]
# to [[submit]]
#: {{uxi|ru|выносить [[вопро́с]] [[на]] [[обсужде́ние]]|to submit a question to discussion}}
# to [[pass]], to [[render]], to [[pronounce]] (a decision or a verdict)
# to [[endure]], to [[bear]], to [[stand]], to [[sustain]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|4c|выноси́ть|prpp=+}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|вынесе́ние}}
* {{l|ru|вы́нестись}}
* {{l|ru|вы́нос}}
* {{l|ru|выноситься}}
* {{l|ru|выноска}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|вы́носить|pf|impf=вына́шивать}}

# to [[carry]], to [[bear]], to [[bring forth]], to [[be]] [[pregnant]] with (a child, an egg)
# to [[nurture]], to [[hatch]], to [[mature]] (an idea, plans)

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4a+p|вы́носить}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|вына́шивание}}
